WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.271
"Poppy," said Eddy.

2
00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:15.225
"You have a flat tire."

3
00:00:15.226 --> 00:00:23.800
"I don't care," said Poppy.

4
00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:34.436
Thump, thump, thump!

5
00:00:34.437 --> 00:00:38.735
"Come here, Poppy!" called Ms. Fender.

6
00:00:38.736 --> 00:00:44.642
"You need a new tire!"

7
00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.844
"I'm okay," said Poppy.

8
00:00:47.845 --> 00:00:51.727
"I want to keep playing tag!"

9
00:00:51.728 --> 00:00:54.149
Thump, thump, thump!

10
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.687
Poppy chased her friends.

11
00:00:58.688 --> 00:01:06.587
But she was slow now.

12
00:01:06.588 --> 00:01:10.295
"Listen to Ms. Fender," said Eddy.

13
00:01:10.296 --> 00:01:12.889
"You need a new tire."

14
00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:16.095
"Nah," said Poppy.

15
00:01:16.096 --> 00:01:18.683
"I'm fine."

16
00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:21.113
Poppy drove forward.

17
00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.610
She drove backward.

18
00:01:23.611 --> 00:01:26.046
Thump, thump, thump.

19
00:01:26.047 --> 00:01:28.574
"See?" said Poppy.

20
00:01:28.575 --> 00:01:31.468
"I can still drive.

21
00:01:31.469 --> 00:01:35.631
Let's keep playing tag!"

22
00:01:35.632 --> 00:01:40.228
Poppy chased her friends.

23
00:01:40.229 --> 00:01:43.223
Ms. Fender frowned.

24
00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:46.262
Poppy tried to tag Eddy.

25
00:01:46.263 --> 00:01:48.715
But Eddy drove away.

26
00:01:48.716 --> 00:01:52.177
Then . . .

27
00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:55.381
"Uh-oh, Poppy!" said Dipper.

28
00:01:55.382 --> 00:01:59.080
"I see smoke!"

